{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0333_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9c29a647607391e841b1d3a26b65a6677ce0e6b0fe998750bc011c08a1b82227", "ja": "（『FantasticLight』公演が終わり、片付け中。\nステージには、まだライブの熱気が残っている……）", "zh": "（《FantasticLight》公演结束后，正在收拾东西。舞台上还残留着演唱会的热烈气氛……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0333_1001_045kar", "source_sha256": "feaa9f8c433b9412da3ae1bfdede0f930286605511174704337c88c1bd03b711", "ja": "あ、あのっ……{$P$}さん、\nお疲れさまです。い、今ちょっと、いいですか……？", "zh": "啊，那个……{$P$}先生，\n辛苦了。现、现在方便说几句话吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0333_1002_p", "source_sha256": "f5b34f574e50940b517146cde95c87218f580a91b4cdded7017666074ff9d04a", "ja": "ん？　可憐、お疲れさま。\nいいけど、どうしたんだ？　着替えもしないで。", "zh": "嗯？可怜，辛苦了。\n可以啊，怎么了吗？衣服都还没换。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0333_1003_045kar", "source_sha256": "731511bf7316c26090bf25bac425e4f79ec12df611c7479518276779f72c8fd0", "ja": "ええと……まだ{$P$}さんの、\nライブの感想、聞いていなかったなと思って……。", "zh": "那个……我想起来还没听到您对{$P$}先生的演出感想……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0333_1004_p", "source_sha256": "a884c5774d85b5e79a73fbf354980f999cee0eabb76c8536611b3df1654cbb94", "ja": "ああ、うん。劇場外の会場だから、何かと忙しくてな。\n片付けが終わってからと思ってた。ゴメンな。", "zh": "啊，嗯。因为演出场地不在剧场，总会有很多事情要忙。\n我是想着等收拾完之后再说的。抱歉啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0333_1005_045kar", "source_sha256": "35e66252b48664173b1fc31da3f587fbc0812c9941bdb05bb710019cd122fae9", "ja": "い、いえ、私の方こそ……！\nごめんなさい、す、すごく気になってしまって。", "zh": "不、不会，我这边才是……！\n对不起，我、我实在太在意了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0333_1006_045kar", "source_sha256": "880003b4edf647fe3a43fff1d39462addff3f995c79df06725dcec3bfeecb97f", "ja": "それで、あの……。\nど、どうでしたか？　今回のステージ……。", "zh": "所以，那个……\n这、这次的舞台……感觉怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0333_1007_p", "source_sha256": "9c2eea4506aaf44e0d8ed77ab0df3434382b8bf24da255628c4be17997588f37", "ja": "もちろん、最高だったよ！　見ている間ずっと、\nこの時間が永遠に続けばいいのにって思ってた。", "zh": "当然棒极了！看着的时候我一直在想，\n要是这段时间能永远持续下去就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0333_1008_p", "source_sha256": "0bfd148c3b5ea1dcb9f94410505142b7b2797dec2e6732b7ef784a8821a0bbbe", "ja": "可憐も、みんなも、本当に頑張ってくれたな！", "zh": "可怜也是，大家也是，真的很努力呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0333_1009_045kar", "source_sha256": "10810b2e1eed53599d8472b8bd3840c7cfc4069d0345b99707f0828ba9dd3e82", "ja": "………………………………きゅ～。", "zh": "………………………………晕过去了～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0333_1010_p", "source_sha256": "00703a3bed62c46eb659c50519b0498f966e6704fa3b538460d644c2e0893d9c", "ja": "可憐！？　だ、大丈夫か！？\nすぐ医務室に……！", "zh": "可怜！？　没、没事吧！？\n马上送去医务室……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0333_1011_045kar", "source_sha256": "f5f8ebad8e17459a99cf8c3648be78aa982d0256fd36c4c3e02ba6c25e6e2d0d", "ja": "はっ……！　だ、大丈夫です。\nすみません、ちょっと気が遠くなって……うぅ。", "zh": "哈……！没、没事。\n对不起，我刚才只是有点意识模糊……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0333_1012_045kar", "source_sha256": "3c7e008618d089ad1dc51c79d5de33e46af45e8b6d73512b497fac69f764cb81", "ja": "ホッとしたのと嬉しいので、力が抜けてしまって……。\nう、うぅっ……ご、ごめんなさい、ぐすっ。", "zh": "因为松了口气，又很开心，不小心就浑身没力气了……  \n呜、呜呜……对、对不起，抽泣……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0333_1013_p", "source_sha256": "ab758361f7a4938bf2fbe71f95a6b34d254d54a918d232134c3bb0654e59ab57", "ja": "可憐……。", "zh": "可怜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0333_1014", "source_sha256": "65cf3cd70c3954412eafe6ef68a04fb249660dee69e83e8cec2806b6a9b73925", "ja": "ハンカチを渡す", "zh": "递出手帕", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0333_2000_p", "source_sha256": "d67f8add78046eb9c65a2158a7beadadbf49d9ed8bd5a993e26bd55daca4cfae", "ja": "ほらこれ、使って。", "zh": "来，拿这个用。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0333_2001_045kar", "source_sha256": "cb2d2e1c4ba7d863e7d63651112610ccee43d22683dc19532917a4acd0b44efc", "ja": "あ、ありがとう、ございます……ぐすっ。\nえへへ……自分でも、び、びっくりして、ます……。", "zh": "啊，谢谢……呜咽。\n嘿嘿……连我自己都、都吓了一跳……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0333_2002_045kar", "source_sha256": "36859d14069ef2c09c212961db48edc521dd1c33f59df9ffbfde0763e25e94d1", "ja": "こ、今回、みんなで繋いできたバトンだから……。\n絶対、失敗できないって……。", "zh": "因、因为这次是大家一起传递下来的接力棒……  \n绝、绝对不能失败……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0333_2003_p", "source_sha256": "773e242c05b90cf4ac963f76e08ff309ff5ed9214a6fb9dfcdc206774dfd5ab5", "ja": "ああ、わかるよ。そのプレッシャーをはねのけて、\n堂々としたパフォーマンスを見せてくれたんだよな。", "zh": "啊，我明白。你们顶住了那份压力，展现出了堂堂正正的表演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0333_2004_p", "source_sha256": "128ac83dbf560db2ff7a97f58de5a8ecfc949a15132d860d4791dc96533a5f9b", "ja": "可憐は、自慢のアイドルだよ。本当にありがとうな。", "zh": "可怜是我引以为傲的偶像。真的很谢谢你啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0333_2005_045kar", "source_sha256": "0df01be4c70d4d6f2dc45c35a102f3614c1f936c25cd3d2094e649169acd7fe5", "ja": "うぅ、ぐすっ……ご、ごめんなさい。\n私、すぐ泣くし、ご迷惑ばっかりかけて……で、でも。", "zh": "呜呜，抽泣……对、对不起。\n我总是动不动就哭，还光是给您添麻烦……但、但是。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0333_2006_045kar", "source_sha256": "45d76de351dc2d10bbf55f308fb3d9a3721c80e3426b00ef16efac7857004251", "ja": "こ、これからも、頑張ります！　ずっと、\n自慢のアイドルって、思ってもらえるように……。", "zh": "我、我今后也会努力的！希望能一直成为让您引以为傲的偶像……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0333_2007_045kar", "source_sha256": "feefc2d24c544cfb4f4a99aa418e9d59e4b79baa15c6f6907c6641bff5f9b5bd", "ja": "だから……ぶ、武道館は……期待してくれて、\nいいですよ？　なんて……てへへ♪　ぐすっ……。", "zh": "所以……武、武道馆……可以期待一下哦？什么的……嘿嘿♪ 抽泣……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0333_2008_p", "source_sha256": "02790cf8682c0c08b4cf7d6a64d670325c662cdd791bd227c6e8a71560b82b6a", "ja": "（涙に濡れた瞳の奥に、挑戦的な光がちらつく……\nその笑顔に、思わず見とれてしまった）", "zh": "（泪水盈眶的双眼深处，闪烁着挑战的光芒……不由得看着那张笑脸入了迷）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_045kar0333_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_045kar0333_2009_p", "source_sha256": "8a4b3c7e08aa8f6470b93ed883a94238a66246d7fc2aa5fc19c46f73200be1fb", "ja": "（言われなくても、期待せずにはいられない。\n楽しみにさせてもらうとしよう！）", "zh": "（不用多说，我也不禁开始期待起来。\n那就好好期待吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
